=== PHASE 4: BOOTSTRAP RACE ON POSTGRESQL ===
  Testing P2002 (unique constraint) behavior on PostgreSQL
  PostgreSQL unique violation aborts the current transaction
  Checking if "catch P2002 → re-read" works within the same transaction
  Writer 2: Got unique violation — PostgreSQL aborts transaction
  GLOBAL rows: 1 (expected 1)

  PostgreSQL unique violation behavior:
    When INSERT fails with unique violation, PostgreSQL aborts the ENTIRE transaction.
    Subsequent statements in the same transaction will fail with:
    "current transaction is aborted, commands ignored until end of transaction block"

  Re-read after ON CONFLICT: SUCCESS (1 rows)
